~ start
do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(750.0, -100.0), 0.5, 3, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
#					haracter, direction, distance, speed, animate, moonwalk
#do! CutsceneManager.npc_move("Az", "left", 200.0, 100.0, false, false)
Fenn: Whoa! Are you [color="red"]Az[/color]? [color="red"]Az Featherstone[/color]?
#							Relative Position,		Zoom x and y, trans duration, transition type, ease type
#do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(200.0, 200.0), Vector2(1.0, 1.0), 2.0, "LINEAR", "EASE_IN")
Az: Yeah- [wait=0.2]Wait, what?
Fenn: [speed=1.5]The great blacksmith apprentice and daughter of the [/speed][speed=2][wave]incredible Knight of Smithing, [color="red"]Abdullah Featherstone[/color]?[/wave][/speed]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.2")
Fenn: [speed=2]Oh by Post! This is really happening. [speed=3]What is he like? Abdul? Is he cool? I bet he's really cool. What's the coolest thing he's made? Is it-
Az: [i]cough[/i] Slow down, kid. What's your name?
Fenn: Fenn!
Az: Okay, Fenn. Love the enthusiasm, but I'm kinda busy right now. 
Az: My [color="red"]Baba[/color] is trapped in the Council Chamber, and I saw one of those [color="purple"]"Wizards"[/color] escape into the Cellar.
Fenn: Really?! [shake]ADVENTURE AWAITS!![/shake]
Az: Absolutely not, kid. It's not safe. Stay here.
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.2")
Fenn: [speed=1.5]Wait, wait, wait. [/speed][speed=2]Are you gonna breathe fire? [/speed][speed=3]I know Adbul can breathe fire. That's so cool. I wish I could breathe fire. Are-[/speed]
Az: Okay! Okay. Listen, I need to go grab something. I'll be back soon. Will you stay here?
Fenn: Hm... no promises.
Az: [i]cough[/i] Seriously?
Fenn: Yup!
Az: [shake]Ugh[/shake]. Whatever.
#Az runs off.
do CutsceneManager.remove_npc("Az")
[wait=1]
do CutsceneManager._end_cutscene()
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-Meet-GreatHall", true)
=> END